  "description": "A production-ready, ultra-lightweight real-time SQL Server table tracking engine built on Microsoft.Data.SqlClient. Features self-cleaning infrastructure, thread-isolated recursion protection, and an internal bounded memory channel to handle high-frequency data spikes and pause/resume event scheduling safely.",
